DESCRIPTION:[Ben McNally Books Social]\nJoin us at Ben McNally Books for o
 ur second Social!\nWe're hosting a little get together. We'll have some ni
 bbles and some drinkies\, and we invite you to come join the festivities.\
 nWe'll do a bit of a presentation to talk about some recent favourite book
 s\, some news\, as well as well as some upcoming plans for the shop.\n\nBu
 t\, more than anything\, we wanted to create a space for people to mingle 
 and socialize and get to know fellow booklovers.
