 ass Hotel\,\nand\nSea of Tranquility\n)\nWe hope that you'll join us to ta
 lk about the book\, enjoy a cookie\, and get a bit of exclusive access to 
 the store.\nPlease note: you'll need to buy a ticket to the meeting if you
 're hoping to attend. However\, you won't be charged for the ticket if you
  also buy a copy of the book.
